WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:23.694
One day Dirk rang the bell.

2
00:00:23.695 --> 00:00:34.822
"Servants and knights to the Royal Ballroom!" he yelled.

3
00:00:34.823 --> 00:00:39.362
"Something is wrong," Tom thought.

4
00:00:39.363 --> 00:00:45.682
He followed everyone to the ballroom.

5
00:00:45.683 --> 00:00:52.832
The king paced up and down.

6
00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:57.668
"A dragon is approaching the palace," he said.

7
00:00:57.669 --> 00:00:59.958
"And it breathes fire!"

8
00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:06.184
Everyone gasped. "Fire?"

9
00:01:06.185 --> 00:01:10.453
"Knights, climb to the highest towers," the king ordered.

10
00:01:10.454 --> 00:01:13.922
"Get ready to throw your swords at the dragon."

11
00:01:13.923 --> 00:01:15.757
"Yes, Your Majesty!"

12
00:01:15.758 --> 00:01:22.989
The knights hurried off.

13
00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:27.474
"Servants, gather some boulders," the king said.

14
00:01:27.475 --> 00:01:30.325
"Get ready to throw them at the dragon."

15
00:01:30.326 --> 00:01:32.059
"Yes, Your Majesty!"

16
00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:34.056
The servants hurried off.

17
00:01:34.057 --> 00:01:39.141
Then the king rushed away too.

18
00:01:39.142 --> 00:01:40.796
Tom looked at Dirk.

19
00:01:40.797 --> 00:01:43.058
"Should I do a spell?"

20
00:01:43.059 --> 00:01:45.801
"No!" Dirk scowled.

21
00:01:45.802 --> 00:01:49.380
"This is a serious problem, Wizard.

22
00:01:49.381 --> 00:01:57.864
Just stay here—out of everyone's way!"

23
00:01:57.865 --> 00:02:02.758
Dirk left the ballroom.

24
00:02:02.759 --> 00:02:04.643
Tom was mad.

25
00:02:04.644 --> 00:02:09.728
He kicked the wall hard.

26
00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:13.978
"Ouch! My foot!" Tom cried.

27
00:02:13.979 --> 00:02:20.575
A tapestry fell off the wall and hit Tom.

28
00:02:20.576 --> 00:02:24.136
Cat jumped out of his pocket.

29
00:02:24.137 --> 00:02:27.817
"Are you okay?" she asked.

30
00:02:27.818 --> 00:02:30.618
"Yes." Tom nodded.

31
00:02:30.619 --> 00:02:34.117
"But I'm the royal wizard.

32
00:02:34.118 --> 00:02:38.689
I want to help with the dragon."

33
00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:42.088
"Then go help," Cat said.

34
00:02:42.089 --> 00:02:44.351
Tom shook his head.

35
00:02:44.352 --> 00:02:47.059
"Dirk said to stay—"

36
00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:49.979
A door flew open.

37
00:02:49.980 --> 00:03:02.823
Then Dirk stormed back inside.
